// Ch10 lore find (optional): a Stillguard shield-strap grown into a mangrove root, the Order's stitch still in it.
// Some Cantor's guardian walked this fen before Toma. Toma does not say what he thinks it means. Sets
// ch10_found_guardian_strap.
title: ch10_find_guardian_strap
location: ch10/ossa_fen
---
Toma [neutral]: A shield-strap. Stillguard stitch. Look, the double run along the edge. #line:ch10_strap_001
Liss [neutral]: The root's grown right through it. That's not last year. #line:ch10_strap_002
Toma [neutral]: No. Somebody walked a Cantor through here before me. #line:ch10_strap_003
<<if $ch10_heard_ressa>>
    Pell [neutral]: Many walked through. Some walked back. #line:ch10_strap_004
<<endif>>
Toma [neutral]: I will leave it. It is where he put it down. #line:ch10_strap_005
<<set $ch10_found_guardian_strap = true>>
===
